sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Controller
    participant O as OrderService
    participant I as Inventory
    participant P as Payment
    C->>+O: placeOrder(sku, qty)
    O->>+I: reserve(sku, qty)
    I-->>-O: reserved
    O->>+P: charge(cents)
    P-->>-O: approved or declined
    alt approved
        O->>I: commit(sku, qty)
        O-->>C: CONFIRMED
    else declined
        O->>I: release(sku, qty)
        O-->>C: PAYMENT_DECLINED
    end
    deactivate O
